    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unsettling, infinite expanse of the Backrooms, where surreal visuals and eerie liminal spaces create an atmosphere of constant unease. With the help of an RC car, you'll navigate unique levels and uncover twisted truths hidden across different chapters. There are no entities lurking in the dark, but the true terror lies in the secrets you'll unravel, revealing that the greatest danger isn't what you can see, but what you have yet to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/44ec6ced061154946a2a76488ed57638.webp?t=1749772993\" width=434 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/653826e891852d2899bbcdbdf72c15d2.avif?t=1749772993\" width=524 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unnerving Reality with Deep, Unsettling Secrets That Will Twist Your Perception and Expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010380/extras/ea0eb27a0ae7a0c9a610cf9704057e65.webp?t=1749772993\" width=434 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh