ou navigate through the eerie silence, to uncover hidden secrets and unravel the mysteries of this realm .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tape 101 is inspired by the internet fictional concept &quot;<strong>The Backrooms&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other inspirations includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruster :\u00a0Backrooms - Level 0 \u201cRC Car\u201d (found footage)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kauffman : Backrooms - 2005</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JD Archive :\u00a0The Backrooms - Unknown Tape (Found footage)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kane Pixels :\u00a0The Backrooms (Found Footage)</strong></p></li></ul>",
